msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:288
msgid "Go to Settings, then Email reports."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:289
msgid "Turn on Send reports automatically and choose how often and at what hour."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:290
msgid "Enter the sender address and the recipient addresses."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:291
msgid "Save the report settings. The report is sent at the hour you chose."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:293
msgid "Install an industry pack"
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:294
msgid "Go to Vertical Packs and find your vertical."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:295
msgid "Install it, then review the services and answers it adds."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:296
msgid "Change or remove anything that does not fit your business."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:298
msgid "Verify webhook events on your side"
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:299
msgid "Switch WebHook on from the Add-ons screen, then enter your receiving URL and a secret of at least 32 characters."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:300
msgid "On your side, compute HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body with the same secret."
