#: tzfd-help.inc.php:304
msgid "Block spam bots and a known spammer"
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:305
msgid "Go to Settings, then Other settings, and turn on Block spam bots."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:306
msgid "Go to Addons, then Email Blacklist."
