#: tzfd-help.inc.php:356
msgid "Front Desk menu"
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:358
msgid "Set up Front Desk (Start setup opens the setup wizard), at-a-glance counts, and the next appointments."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:359
msgid "Every booking from every calendar, in Day, Week or Month view. Filter to one calendar, and open a booking to go to its Booking Orders. Manage calendars opens the Calendars List, where you create, edit, clone or delete a calendar."
