#: tzfd-help.inc.php:362
msgid "Workers & locations"
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:362
msgid "One page with three tabs. Team lists the workers, with their hours, days off and contact details, and the availability preview. Locations lists the places where they are based, with address, phone, timezone and postcodes covered. Equipment & rooms lists the resources bookings use. None of these change existing bookings."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:363
msgid "Switch add-ons on or off, and set each add-on’s options."
msgstr ""

#: tzfd-help.inc.php:364
msgid "The settings sections include General, Booking rules, Business hours, Notifications, Integrations and Advanced."
